---
// The Cyclical P/E Paradox across Peak Earnings (low P/E = trap) vs Trough Earnings (high P/E / low P/B = bottom).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 285;
---
<figure class="sbp7-cyc">
  <div class="sbp7-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Cyclical P/E paradox on a commodity stock (e.g. Steel, BVPS = 20,000 VND): at Cycle Peak, stock hits 45,000 VND and EPS hits 10,000 VND (P/E 4.5x looks cheap, P/B 2.25x is pricey); at Cycle Trough, stock drops to 16,000 VND and EPS shrinks to 500 VND (P/E 32x looks expensive, P/B 0.8x signals cyclical floor).">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp7-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>The Cyclical P/E Paradox: why steel looks "cheapest" at the peak and "expensive" at the bottom</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nghịch lý P/E cổ phiếu chu kỳ: vì sao ngành thép nhìn "rẻ nhất" đúng lúc đỉnh và "đắt nhất" ngay đáy</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Peak card */}
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="420" height="206" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cycle Peak (Commodity Boom — Danger!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đỉnh chu kỳ (Giá hàng hóa sốt — Bẫy!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Market Price: 45,000 đ (BVPS = 20,000 đ)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thị giá: 45.000 đ (Giá trị sổ sách = 20.000 đ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="152" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Peak EPS: 10,000 đ (temporary 50% ROE!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• EPS đỉnh tạm thời: 10.000 đ (ROE vọt 50%!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="182" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>P/E = 4.5x (looks cheap!) · P/B = 2.25x</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>P/E = 4,5x (tưởng rẻ!) · P/B = 2,25x</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="216" class="sbp7-sub sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Wait: when spreads cool, EPS drops → price crashes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hệ quả: biên lãi hạ nhiệt → EPS sụt, giá lao dốc</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Trough card */}
      <rect x="460" y="56" width="420" height="206" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={488} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="514" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cycle Trough (Recession — Opportunity)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đáy chu kỳ (Ngành ảm đạm — Vùng thấp)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Market Price: 16,000 đ (BVPS = 20,000 đ)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thị giá: 16.000 đ (Giá trị sổ sách = 20.000 đ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="152" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Trough EPS: 500 đ (barely breaking even)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• EPS đáy tạm thời: 500 đ (gần hòa vốn)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="182" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>P/E = 32.0x (looks pricey!) · P/B = 0.80x</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>P/E = 32,0x (trông đắt!) · P/B = 0,80x</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="216" class="sbp7-sub sbp7-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Assets sit below book while survival balance holds</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mua tài sản thấp hơn giá sổ sách khi nợ an toàn</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Peter Lynch's classic cyclical rule: buy commodity stocks when trailing P/E looks terrifyingly high near depressed book value (provided debt is survivable), and be cautious when cyclical P/E drops under 5x at record margins.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Quy tắc cổ phiếu chu kỳ kinh điển của Peter Lynch: thận trọng khi P/E thép/vận tải rơi về mức 4–5 lần ở đỉnh biên lợi nhuận kỷ lục, và theo dõi lúc P/E cao ngất quanh đáy P/B &lt; 1 (với điều kiện nợ vay an toàn).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp7-cyc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp7-cyc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp7-cyc text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp7-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp7-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp7-body { font-size: 12.8px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp7-cyc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
